# 3. Ideas Explored

Three possible project ideas were considered before selecting the final MVP.

## Hotel Girasol Stock Flow

A digital inventory and product movement system designed for Hotel Girasol.

The system would track inventory quantities and record product deliveries and restocking transactions.

## Hotel Maintenance Tracker

A system for managing hotel maintenance requests.

Employees could report problems involving rooms, equipment, plumbing, electrical systems, air conditioning, furniture, and common areas.

## Employee Shift Task Manager

A system for organizing and monitoring responsibilities during employee shifts.

Employees and supervisors could track assigned tasks, priorities, statuses, and completion times.

