# 7. Selected MVP Concept

The selected MVP is:

## Hotel Girasol Stock Flow

Hotel Girasol Stock Flow will maintain current inventory information and record product movements during hotel operations.

The core product delivery workflow follows:

**Employee → Product → Quantity → Room → Date → Time**

For example, if an employee delivers two units of a product to Room 204, the application will record:

* Employee responsible
* Product
* Quantity: 2
* Room: 204
* Current date
* Current time

The corresponding inventory quantity will then be reduced.

The transaction will also remain available in the historical transaction record.

---

# 8. Problem Statement

Hotel Girasol currently depends heavily on manual inventory verification.

A complete inventory check can take approximately **40 minutes**.

The system also lacks immediate digital visibility into product movement.

Hotel Girasol Stock Flow aims to improve this workflow by maintaining:

* Current product quantities
* Product delivery records
* Restocking records
* Employee information
* Room information
* Transaction timestamps
* Inventory transaction history

The application will not completely eliminate physical inventory checks.

Instead, it will provide better inventory information so that physical verification can be performed when it is actually necessary.

