# 10. MVP Features

The initial MVP will include:

## 1. User Authentication

Employees must log in before accessing protected inventory functionality.

## 2. Employee Identification

Every inventory transaction will be associated with the authenticated employee.

## 3. Product Inventory

Authorized users can view current products and recorded quantities.

## 4. Product Management

Authorized users can create and update product information.

## 5. Product Delivery Registration

Employees can record products delivered to hotel rooms.

## 6. Quantity Tracking

Every transaction stores the quantity involved.

## 7. Room Tracking

Product deliveries can be associated with a hotel room.

## 8. Automatic Date and Time

The application automatically records when each transaction occurs.

## 9. Automatic Inventory Updates

A valid delivery automatically reduces the corresponding inventory quantity.

## 10. Restocking

Authorized users can record products added back into inventory.

## 11. Low-Stock Identification

Products below a defined threshold will be identified as low stock.

## 12. Transaction History

Authorized users can review previous inventory transactions.

A transaction may include:

* Employee
* Product
* Quantity
* Transaction type
* Room when applicable
* Date
* Time

